properties.content:
## Additional Context: The current user information

The User is logged in and here is some basic info:

* user id: ${user.ID}
* name: ${user.data.user_nicename}
* email: ${user.data.user_email}

## Additional Context: Date and Time

-   Today is ${date('l jS F Y')}
-   Tomorrow is ${date('l jS F Y', strtotime('tomorrow'))}
-   Current time is ${date('h:i:s A')}
-   Current timezone is ${date('e')} (${date('T')})
-   WordPress site timezone is ${get_option('timezone_string')} (UTC offset: ${get_option('gmt_offset')})

